型的核心功能，包含续写（Video Continue），用于在原有短视频基础上，无缝延长时长、补全画面边界、保持角色 / 光影 / 运镜一致性，解决 AI 视频 “短、碎、不可控” 的痛点。\n\nRH Wan 2.7 Video Extend is a core feature of Alibaba Cloud Wan 2.7 video foundation model. It integrates Video Continue capability to seamlessly extend video duration, complete frame boundaries, and maintain consistency in characters, lighting and camera movement based on existing short videos, addressing the pain points of short length, fragmented frames and poor controllability in AI-generated videos."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "RH Wan 2.7 Video Extend.7 视频全维度编辑（万相 2.7 视频扩展 / 续写）", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [581.0208740234375, 369.83050537109375], "pos": [-784.721435546875, -263.1484069824219], "id": 9, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["例如：\n\n原视频长度为5秒\n\n新视频长度duration可设置为10秒\n\n\nFor example:\n\nThe original video lasts 5 seconds.\n\nThe duration of the new video can be set to 10 seconds.\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "关于时长 About Duration", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [581.0208740234375, 369.83050537109375], "pos": [-782.8257446289062, 201.7628936767578], "id": 32, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "video", "links": [13], "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"name": "url", "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["720P", "10", "画面中心是一位年轻东亚女性，留着蓬松的中短发，发丝被午后阳光镀上暖金色，在微风中轻扬，自带灵动氛围感。\n中景，镜头渐渐拉远，展现女主完整坐姿：坐在林间石凳 / 草地上，双腿自然交叠，书本放在膝头，抬头望向远处的树影，眼神放空，陷入沉思。\n远景：女主沿林间小路行走，小路被阳光照亮，两侧是茂密树林，人物在画面中占比缩小，融入自然。", "", true, 1924229686, "randomize", false], "inputs": [{"name": "video", "link": 12, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio", "label": "audi